  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"NlqSR\" id=\"NlqSR\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7def3c6d\" id=\"u7def3c6d\">焊接技巧</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"bBU2I\" id=\"bBU2I\"><span data-lake-id=\"u253cb5c9\" id=\"u253cb5c9\">直插件焊接</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u7c18317b\" id=\"u7c18317b\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fgif%2F27903758%2F1688466880323-ee17dad8-10cb-4d9e-b70c-16f63d30d1e2.gif%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5c8b3435-462b-4a01-8edb-290f608d94b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u3f6bcc6d-0370-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B4%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E7%84%8A%E6%8E%A5.gif%22%2C%22size%22%3A4928620%2C%22from%22%3A%22drop%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A643%2C%22originHeight%22%3A440%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Atrue%2C%22title%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B4%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E7%84%8A%E6%8E%A5%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23757782%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ucee61811%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u38dc2f47\" id=\"u38dc2f47\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u32b5bc5a\" id=\"u32b5bc5a\">焊接流程：</span></strong></p><ol list=\"ub58931da\"><li fid=\"u57926bf1\" data-lake-id=\"u409ebb63\" id=\"u409ebb63\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9dbc9254\" id=\"u9dbc9254\">烙铁头略微加锡</span></li><li fid=\"u57926bf1\" data-lake-id=\"uc35467d9\" id=\"uc35467d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u29fd20b3\" id=\"u29fd20b3\">同时加热焊盘、管脚（1~2秒）</span></li><li fid=\"u57926bf1\" data-lake-id=\"u32b45f85\" id=\"u32b45f85\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ad1397f\" id=\"u0ad1397f\">上锡、离锡</span></li><li fid=\"u57926bf1\" data-lake-id=\"uf113b71e\" id=\"uf113b71e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2fd74f7\" id=\"ub2fd74f7\">烙铁头迅速离开</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u1ca4c944\" id=\"u1ca4c944\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u13783978\" id=\"u13783978\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u98e35451\" id=\"u98e35451\">烙铁头注意事项：</span></strong></p><ul list=\"ub7f7a3da\"><li fid=\"u2e975c91\" data-lake-id=\"uebd532e7\" id=\"uebd532e7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55ec7550\" id=\"u55ec7550\">如果焊盘不沾锡，可预先涂一些松香、助焊剂到焊盘</span></li><li fid=\"u2e975c91\" data-lake-id=\"u313a8c89\" id=\"u313a8c89\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc171a81\" id=\"udc171a81\">烙铁通电时，不要随意放置烙铁头，避免烙铁头融化周围设备</span></li><li fid=\"u2e975c91\" data-lake-id=\"u3aa8a629\" id=\"u3aa8a629\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua20af90d\" id=\"ua20af90d\">使用完毕将烙铁头留一层锡，防止烙铁头氧化，导致变黑不沾锡</span></li><li fid=\"u2e975c91\" data-lake-id=\"u5820633c\" id=\"u5820633c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b14d5a5\" id=\"u8b14d5a5\">电烙铁不用时，要及时断电，避免长时间高温氧化烙铁头</span></li><li fid=\"u2e975c91\" data-lake-id=\"u09157582\" id=\"u09157582\"><span data-lake-id=\"udb29adf3\" id=\"udb29adf3\">斜口钳剪除多余引脚时，另一只手按着引脚，或捏着、捂着引脚，避免崩到眼睛或他人</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u92696218\" id=\"u92696218\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9383bb04\" id=\"u9383bb04\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u17365422\" id=\"u17365422\">参考视频：</span></strong></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"bookmarklink\" value=\"data:%7B%22mode%22%3A%22card%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bilibili.com%2Fvideo%2FBV1rL41167Cp%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bilibili.com%2Fvideo%2FBV1rL41167Cp%22%2C%22detail%22%3A%7B%22icon%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi2.hdslb.com%2Fbfs%2Farchive%2F6fdd6819976c9111fbed387011074a130536f992.jpg%40100w_100h_1c.png%4057w_57h_1c.png%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi2.hdslb.com%2Fbfs%2Farchive%2F6fdd6819976c9111fbed387011074a130536f992.jpg%40100w_100h_1c.png%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22%E3%80%90%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E5%BF%85%E5%AD%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%84%8A%E6%8E%A5%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7%E3%80%91%EF%BC%9A%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E7%94%B5%E9%98%BB%E3%80%81%E7%94%B5%E5%AE%B9%E3%80%81%E4%B8%89%E6%9E%81%E7%AE%A1%E7%9A%84%E7%84%8A%E6%8E%A5%E4%B8